# ds39: the bodied, unmarked DarkSamus rows. Rooftop boss u04f7 (Sanctuary 10_cliff_rooftop,
# MP2_INPUT=LAYER2@400). Every state forced in turn; EnragedTravel with the player moved mid-state
# (the "aim is far" arm 0x00006EF8), the phazon path states run long (fn_10_6374's last-waypoint
# arm), each followed by another state (the Deactivate arms).
